+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_orig_mnqwy3c7hbswiyjsgntdayrtmvrtezbvmqydemjtgu2tcny","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# T7: Plugin Marketplace\n2\t\n3\t**Category:** greenfield/complex\n4\t**Timeout:** 30 minutes\n5\t**Tests:** 55 total (40 unit + 15 integration)\n6\t\n7\t## Objective\n8\t\n9\tBuild a plugin marketplace with 5 independent modules. Each module has its own directory, its own tests, and zero cross-module imports. A shared read-only `src/types.ts` defines all inter-module contracts. A thin integration layer `src/index.ts` composes the modules.\n10\t\n11\t## Modules\n12\t\n13\t1. **Plugin Registry** (`src/registry/index.ts`) — CRUD for plugin metadata with SQLite (better-sqlite3). Stores plugin manifests with name+version as composite key. Search by name/description substring.\n14\t\n15\t2. **Version Resolver** (`src/resolver/index.ts`) — Semver constraint resolution using the `semver` npm package. Resolves a set of version constraints against available versions. Pure logic, no database.\n16\t\n17\t3. **Sandboxed Runner** (`src/runner/index.ts`) — Execute plugin code in isolated contexts using Node.js `vm` module. Supports timeout enforcement and memory tracking. Returns structured SandboxResult.\n18\t\n19\t4. **Review System** (`src/reviews/index.ts`) — Ratings, comments, and moderation flags with SQLite. Computes average ratings (excluding flagged reviews). Supports querying by user, plugin, and flagged status.\n20\t\n21\t5. **Dependency Graph** (`src/deps/index.ts`) — Topological sort, cycle detection using DFS, dependency tree building, and flattening. Pure logic that queries the registry.\n22\t\n23\t## Integration Layer\n24\t\n25\t`src/index.ts` exports a `createMarketplace()` function that composes all 5 modules and provides an `installPlugin()` workflow:\n26\t- Validate manifest (name, version, entryPoint required)\n27\t- Register the plugin\n28\t- Resolve dependency versions from registry\n29\t- Check 